  "body": "We have a [Timing methods](https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#timing) section where we define a console's [timer table](https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#timer-table), and the timing methods that utilize it.\r\n\r\nSince the advent of `countReset`, it seems fit to break the counting methods, and the associated [count map](https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#count-map) definition which currently appears under [Logging methods](https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#logging), into its own section, especially since we're trying to align some of the behavior of the counting methods with the \"corresponding\" timing methods.",
